OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GTime to switch off. Join
OL,6,     GAFRODEUTSCHE as she plays the
OL,7,     Gsoundtrack to a long, lazy Sunday
OL,8,     Gmorning, bringing you pure
OL,9,     Gcomfort and tranquility.
OL,10,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,11,     GMark and Stuart present a feast
OL,12,     Gof great music and chat for
OL,13,     Gweekend breakfast, plus they
OL,14,     Gcelebrate the 40th anniversary of
OL,15,     GRun-D.M.C.'s album Raising Hell.
OL,16,G1000FCerys Matthews
OL,17,     GCerys hosts your Sunday sonic and
OL,18,     Gcultural adventure, with a
OL,19,     Gsession from Algerian-French
OL,20,     Gsinger Souad Massi and a look at
OL,21,     Gthe folk tradition of stone
OL,22,     Glifting with David Keohan.
